# 📊 AI Data Analyst Agent

An AI-powered data analysis application that allows users to upload CSV or Excel files and ask questions about their data using natural language.

The application uses **Groq LLM** to generate Python/Pandas analysis code, executes the generated code on the actual uploaded dataset, and presents the computed results with tables, visualizations, and AI-generated explanations.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

Traditional data analysis often requires users to know Python, SQL, or Excel formulas.

The **AI Data Analyst Agent** provides a natural-language interface where users can simply ask questions such as:

> Which region has the highest sales?

or

> Which region grew fastest last quarter?

The system understands the question, generates appropriate Pandas code, executes the calculation on the uploaded dataset, and displays the result.

---

## ✨ Features

- 📁 Upload CSV files
- 📊 Upload Excel `.xlsx` files
- 🔍 Automatically inspect dataset structure
- 📋 Preview uploaded data
- 📈 View dataset statistics
- 🔎 View column information
- 💬 Ask questions in natural language
- 🤖 Generate Pandas code using Groq
- 🧮 Perform real calculations on the dataset
- 📊 Display computed results
- 📈 Generate supporting visualizations
- 🐍 Display generated Python code
- 💡 Generate natural-language explanations
- ⬇️ Download analysis results
- 📅 Support date and quarterly analysis
- 🛡️ Basic restrictions on generated code

---

# 🧠 How the Project Works

The project follows this workflow:

```text
User Uploads CSV / Excel
          │
          ▼
   Pandas DataFrame
          │
          ▼
 Natural Language Question
          │
          ▼
       Groq LLM
          │
          ▼
 Generated Python/Pandas Code
          │
          ▼
 Execute Code on Real Dataset
          │
          ▼
    Computed Result
       │       │
       ▼       ▼
   AI Answer  Chart
       │
       ▼
   User Interface